// Acid {{ version }} — {{ flavor.name }}, for Telegram Desktop
//
// Generated by acid from ports/telegram-desktop/theme.tera. Do not edit; edit
// the template, or the palette in crates/acid-palette/src/lib.rs, and re-run
// `make`.
//
// Built from Telegram's own default palette: neutral colours are mapped onto
// the Acid neutral ramp by inverted lightness, so the layering survives, and
// saturated colours snap to the nearest Acid accent. Entries that reference
// another entry upstream still do, so those relationships are kept.
//
// Telegram's source palette allows "value | fallback"; its theme parser does
// not, so only the value is kept.

